Based on pdfcraft
-----------------
Free PDF SDK is based on pdfcraft by the ArtCraft Team and the PdfCraft contributors
(https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft), used as a Cargo dependency pinned to commit

    71b47b519d2c295c2068dc89a8d75690fc7dd7e5 (pdfcraft 0.14.0)

with Free PDF SDK modifications to pdfcraft's interface crate (pdfcraft-ui-egui): opt-in hooks
for white-label branding and for hiding features. The exact modified commit is in Cargo.lock
and in version.json as "pdfcraftRev".

pdfcraft is Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PdfCraft contributors, licensed under
the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its licence files, NOTICE and
ATTRIBUTION.md are in third-party/pdfcraft/.

Trademarks
----------
"ArtCraft", "PdfCraft" and the ArtCraft logos are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team. Free PDF SDK
does not use them as its name or logo, does not display them, and is not endorsed by the
ArtCraft Team. The ArtCraft logos are not compiled into the viewer (pdfcraft-ui-egui is built
without its `artcraft-marks` feature); the names remain only inside pdfcraft's unused message
strings and translations. The placeholder logos in brand/ are original to this project.

